# COSMIC version that Celenn OS is built and tested against (Fedora's
# cosmic-settings package). The theme tool (build_files/theme/Cargo.toml pins
# the matching libcosmic revision) and the tours (build_files/first_steps,
# same libcosmic and Cargo.lock as cosmic-initial-setup) follow it.
# When Fedora ships another version, .github/workflows/check-cosmic-version.yml
# opens a pull request that updates the libcosmic revision and this line, and
# merges it once the image builds. Until then the build stops when Fedora
# ships another version (`just helpers-keys`, build_files/20-cosmic.sh), so a
# new COSMIC never reaches the image without that pull request.
1.12.0
